sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AuthorResource
    participant Jackson
    participant Author
    participant Post

    Client->>AuthorResource: serializeauthor
    activate AuthorResource
    AuthorResource->>Jackson: serializeauthor
    activate Jackson
    Note over Jackson: Jackson encounters Author object
    
    Jackson->>Author: getId
    activate Author
    Note over Jackson: Serialize id field
    Author-->>Jackson: return id (Long)
    deactivate Author
    
    Jackson->>Author: getName
    activate Author
    Note over Jackson: Serialize name field
    Author-->>Jackson: return name (String)
    deactivate Author
    
    Jackson->>Author: getEmail
    activate Author
    Note over Jackson: Serialize email field
    Author-->>Jackson: return email (String)
    deactivate Author
    
    Jackson->>Author: getPosts
    activate Author
    Note over Jackson: Access posts collection
    Author-->>Jackson: return posts list (List[Post])
    deactivate Author
    
    loop for each post
        Jackson->>Post: serializepost
        activate Post
        Note over Jackson: Serialize each post in collection
        Jackson->>Post: getAuthor
        Note over Jackson: Attempt to serialize author reference
        deactivate Post
    end
    
    Jackson->>Jackson: apply JsonBackReference
    activate Jackson
    Note over Jackson: Apply JsonBackReference to prevent circular reference in posts
    deactivate Jackson
    
    Jackson-->>Client: return JSON string (String)
    Note over Jackson: JSON representation with circular reference prevented
    deactivate Jackson
    deactivate AuthorResource